There exist constants $0<c_*\le C$ such that $$\begin{equation}
c_*\,(1-t)^{-1/4}\le\|u^*(t)\|_{\dot H^1}\le C\,(1-t)^{-1/4}\qquad(0\le t<1).\tag{4.4}
